  "title": "Independence acceptance memorandum",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Independence acceptance memorandum</h2><p>You are the ethics reviewer for a firm considering four proposed arrangements for a nonissuer financial-statement audit. Determine the appropriate conclusion for each fact pattern.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs1-f1\">Arrangement A: appropriate conclusion</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs1-f1\"><option value=\"Prohibited direct financial interest\">Prohibited direct financial interest</option><option value=\"Permitted because shares are immaterial\">Permitted because shares are immaterial</option><option value=\"Permitted with client consent\">Permitted with client consent</option><option value=\"Management responsibility\">Management responsibility</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs1-f2\">Arrangement B: appropriate conclusion</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs1-f2\"><option value=\"Evaluate and document nonattest safeguards\">Evaluate and document nonattest safeguards</option><option value=\"Automatically prohibited for every nonissuer\">Automatically prohibited for every nonissuer</option><option value=\"No professional responsibilities apply\">No professional responsibilities apply</option><option value=\"Client waiver substitutes for oversight\">Client waiver substitutes for oversight</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs1-f3\">Arrangement C: primary issue</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs1-f3\"><option value=\"Assuming management responsibility\">Assuming management responsibility</option><option value=\"Only an immaterial financial interest\">Only an immaterial financial interest</option><option value=\"No independence issue\">No independence issue</option><option value=\"A required audit procedure\">A required audit procedure</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs1-f4\">Arrangement D: required first action</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs1-f4\"><option value=\"Resolve authorization and confidentiality protections\">Resolve authorization and confidentiality protections</option><option value=\"Upload because the data is useful\">Upload because the data is useful</option><option value=\"Obtain only the tool’s accuracy score\">Obtain only the tool’s accuracy score</option><option value=\"Delay documentation until after upload\">Delay documentation until after upload</option></select></div></section>",
