    {
      "id": "aud-m1-tbs1-ex1",
      "title": "Proposed arrangements",
      "html": "<p>A: The engagement partner directly owns 20 client shares. B: The firm will prepare a proposed depreciation schedule; a competent controller chooses methods and accepts responsibility. C: An auditor will sign purchase orders for the client. D: Confidential customer data will be sent to a public tool without authorization.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "aud-m1-tbs1-ex2",
      "title": "Evaluation instructions",
      "html": "<p>Assume all individuals described are covered members. No exception applies to direct interests or management responsibilities. For permitted nonattest assistance, management must oversee, evaluate, and accept the results.</p>"
