  "explanation": "<h3>Arrangement A: appropriate conclusion</h3><p>A covered partner’s direct interest impairs independence.</p><h3>Arrangement B: appropriate conclusion</h3><p>Management retains responsibility, so evaluate the service and applicable safeguards.</p><h3>Arrangement C: primary issue</h3><p>Signing purchase orders authorizes client transactions.</p><h3>Arrangement D: required first action</h3><p>Confidentiality duties apply before sharing client data with a third party.</p>"
